  "2026-10-15T07:49:19.022Z",codex-agent,"Dependency remediation verified: exact pm-ops 2026.10.14 and removal of the unused fast-glob peer eliminate braces, fast-glob and micromatch from both full and production-only npm ls trees. Full npm audit --ignore-scripts now reports zero vulnerabilities versus the four high development findings at baseline. No SDK pin changed. Awaiting committed-head npm/Bun gates and self-host acceptance."
  "2026-10-15T09:47:25.240Z",codex-agent,"Verified complete rollout gates on source 90ba1c0: isolated npm and Bun release:check each pass 1536/1536, zero failures/skips, all 65 sources at unchanged per-file 100% statements/lines/branches/functions. Canonical published prepare launcher is aligned with pm-ops 2026.10.14 and its artifact guard is regression-tested. Both full and production-only npm ls braces fast-glob micromatch trees are empty; full npm audit was zero findings after the dependency change and both production audits pass. Native, installed-CLI, packed Node/Bun and self-host acceptances pass. Release this issue in progress for orchestrator verification; do not close it here."
  "2026-10-21T19:11:25.058Z",codex-agent,"Tracker reconciliation authorized for the audited verdict FIXED-STALE. Re-verified unchanged main 27e1d84671fa: delivery 066625091bcc remains in main ancestry; .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml, test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts remain present. Remove vulnerable optional glob dependencies from the fleet duplication gate. [PR #113](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/pull/113) (0666250) drops the optional vulnerable glob chain; fresh npm audit exits 0 with zero findings. Scope: tracker state only; no new runtime certification or deployment claim."
